## Three steps to your first page

{{`{{< steps >}}`}}
1. Add a Markdown file under `content/`.
2. Register it in `docs/router.go` with a title, description, and explicit `Order`.
3. Run `fastr-docs check .` to validate links, anchors, and ordering.
{{`{{< /steps >}}`}}

This page is Markdown front matter, not Go. The typed alternative lives at
[the typed landing example](/examples/typed-landing).
